{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object isn't approached:     if object is visible:         approach object     else:         scan area for object If object is approached:     take object     move to destination     process object task list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ProcessObjectTask    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
